OL,3,GNEWSASinging lemurs use opera
OL,4,Atechnique, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA species of lemur known for its song
OL,7,Fappears to use a similar technique to
OL,8,Fopera singers, researchers have found.
OL,10,FScientists from the University of
OL,11,FWarwick, the University of Turin and
OL,12,Fthe indri lemurs' home nation
OL,13,FMadagascar have spent a number of years
OL,14,Fwatching the species.
OL,16,FThey have produced a new study which
OL,17,Ffinds the lemurs open their mouths
OL,18,Fwider to reach higher notes - similar
OL,19,Fto a trained soprano.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
