OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSASinging lemurs use opera
OL,4,Atechnique, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Chiara De Gregorio, honorary
OL,7,Fresearch fellow at the University of
OL,8,FWarwick, said the animals had shown
OL,9,F"the kind of fine-tuned coordination
OL,10,Fbetween voice and body that we usually
OL,11,Fassociate with trained human singers,
OL,12,Fnot with a lemur singing from the
OL,13,Fforest canopy".
